  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preliminary Assessment 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Preliminary Assessment is a mandatory desk-based process for all sites that may be nominated to the World Heritage List and is undertaken following a request by the relevant State(s) Party(ies). It provides States Parties with an opportunity for enhanced dialogue with the Advisory Bodies, and it helps to establish the feasibility of a potential nomination and avoid the use of resources in the preparation of nominations that may be unlikely to succeed. The current budget will fund the requests for Preliminary Assessment received as of September 2024 and deemed complete.</narrative>
  </description>
